  "text": "COMMONWEALTH OF AUSTRALIA\nDEPARTMENT OF AIR\nVICTORIA BARRACKS\nMELBOURNE, S.C.1\n- 9th June, 1955.\nDear Chales,\nI was delighted to hear the\nnews that Her Majesty had been\ngraciously pleased to make you a\nCommander of the Order of the\nBritish Empire. I hasten to\noffer my congratulations for this\nwell earned award.\nand Mulrones\n(F.J. MULROONEY)\nC.E. MeFadyen, Esq., C.B.E.,\nSecretary,\nDepartment of Shipping ano\nTransport,\n497 Collins Street,\nMELBOURNE.\nPETER AND HELEr.\nMARIE ANa YoUNG BILL.",
